  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted (Unnumbered site location plan, design and access statement, 1048 S 1 and 1048 P 1 received 08/09/2010)  therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 3 - The use hereby permitted shall not be open to customers outside the following times [9am to 11pm Monday to Saturday and 11am to 10pm on Sunday and Bank Holidays].",
    "Condition : 4 - No deliveries shall be taken at or despatched from the site outside the hours of [9am-10pm Monday to Saturday and 11am-9pm on Sundays and Bank Holidays]",
    "Condition : 5 - The use hereby permitted shall not be begun until details of the arrangements for storing of waste and recycled materials have been submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority.  The arrangements for storing waste and recycled materials shall not be carried out otherwise than in accordance with any approval given and shall be completed before the use hereby permitted is begun.",
    "Condition : 6 - A bacterial or enzyme dosing unit shall be fitted on all waste discharge points from kitchen sinks and floor drains prior to discharging to the public sewerage system and shall be permanently retained and maintained in working order",
    "Condition : 7 - Before the use hereby approved begins, a fat trap shall be installed and permanently maintained in working order for the duration of the use and an agreement shall be in place with a contractor for the disposal of fats, oils and grease, particularly to recycle for the production of bio-diesel These arrangements shall be permanently operated and retained.",
    "Condition : 8 - At the time the use hereby permitted first commences, the back door to the premises shall be fitted with a self-closer to be kept permanently in working order and the door shall be kept permanently shut when the kitchen is in operation, except for access purposes and any rear window shall be kept permanently shut."
  ],
